WEBVTT

00:01:29.845 --> 00:01:31.178
(Smijeh)

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:32.419
Ne.

00:01:32.419 --> 00:01:36.198
(Pljesak)

00:01:36.734 --> 00:01:39.732
Pristalice populizma
nisu laka meta za satiru

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:42.256
jer ih pokušavate srediti jedan dan,

00:01:42.256 --> 00:01:43.873
a već idućeg vas nadmaše.

00:01:43.873 --> 00:01:47.259
Primjerice, čim je izabran,

00:01:47.355 --> 00:01:51.495
pokušao sam zamisliti tweet
koji bi Trump objavio na Badnjak.

00:01:51.495 --> 00:01:53.575
I napravio sam ovo, OK?

00:01:53.575 --> 00:01:56.790
[Sretan Božić svima! Osim
svim onim patetičnim luzerima. Tako tužno.]

00:01:56.790 --> 00:01:58.600
(Smijeh)

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:01.104
I u osnovi, idućega dana,
Trump je objavio ovo: